# Generated documentation artifacts.
# docs/pdf/ is rebuilt from the markdown sources with:
#     node scripts/build-docs-pdf.js
# Every delivery round regenerated all 26 PDFs, and git stored each
# rebuild as fresh ~5MB of binary blobs that do not delta-compress --
# which is why .git had grown to 33MB while the actual source is under
# 1MB. Generated output does not belong in version control; the
# markdown sources are the tracked truth, and the PDFs are still built
# and shipped in every package.
docs/pdf/
-e 
